<title>FRANCE: Denis Kessler to join AXA-UAP as MD.</title>
<headline>Denis Kessler to join AXA-UAP as MD.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>AXA-UAP said on Wednesday Denis Kessler, currently head of the French insurance association (FFSA), would be joining the French insurance group as a managing director and board member.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
